        <mxCell id="p1-sdk-upload" value="&lt;b&gt;SDK / Direct Upload Callers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;Smart Shard-Aware Uploads&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; color=&quot;#CBD5E1&quot;&gt;• Requests shard: &lt;b&gt;POST /api/v1/pool/upload-offers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Uploads multipart binary to winning node&lt;br&gt;• Sends &lt;i&gt;X-Actor-Id&lt;/i&gt; audit header" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E293B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
