        <mxCell id="p1-node2-api" value="&lt;b&gt;ContentService.Api (Node 2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;Host :5102 → Container :8080&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; color=&quot;#CBD5E1&quot;&gt;• Identical stateless Minimal API &amp;amp; Pool endpoints&lt;br&gt;• Owns &lt;i&gt;node-2&lt;/i&gt; shard metadata &amp;amp; binaries&lt;br&gt;• Answers &lt;i&gt;locate-image&lt;/i&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;i&gt;upload-offer&lt;/i&gt; broadcasts&lt;br&gt;• Serves peer-proxied streams &amp;amp; reference checks&lt;br&gt;• Scales horizontally to Node N" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1E293B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
